  update `k15-custody-step-zero.mem`'s rows that change. The controller writes the road at the land.
- Crew, battery, commits, fences and hand-back exactly as the K17-R brief at `/home/joshu/.lares-scratch/k17-r/brief.md`
  (sections Crew, Battery and landing, Fences, Hand-back), seat dirs under `/home/joshu/.lares-scratch/k15-bonds/seats/`,
